  baseText: 'Dear sir Montburry


    I have heard of various harbor business initiative
    through the United Kingdom. I myself posess various french harbor initiatives
    and would like to meet you to talk more in depth about an eventual partnership.


    Sincerely,

    Jean-Baptiste
    Lemarchand'
  fragAText: I heard of you and your reputation thanks to your son, Arhur, whose
    financial essay was so compeling I wanted to personaly meet him. We talked a
    long time until he mentioned your various harbor business initiatives. That is
    how I've come to contact you.
  fragBText: 
